I am less enthusiastic with that language. Java was missing essential
language parts for a far too long time. Meanwhile you have them but
must take care in what environment/version you're working; all that
"obsolescent" concept, all those many parallel existing GUI libraries;
nothing that makes me feel comfortable when talking about portability.

> On the other hand, I played around with some Java this afternoon
> (not having used it in the last five years), and have noticed
