Language with intermediate interpreted code suffer from performance
losses; there's not much one can do - besides having a good public
relations unit.

Frankly, I am also not convinced that portability and interpreted
intermediate code are an inseparable prerequisite, especially if I
have to install a specific runtime environment of a certain version.

